# This repo builds Linux containers, and doom-wasm/ vendors Chocolate Doom's
# autotools build (configure.ac, Makefile.am). CRLF anywhere in those breaks
# the build inside the container - autoconf chokes on an embedded \r in the
# AC_OUTPUT file list, and CRLF shebangs fail with "not found". Force LF for
# all text files regardless of the checkout platform's core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep real binaries untouched.
*.wad binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.wasm binary
